ival de crecimiento perenne,​ erguida, rizomatosa, de 30-90 cm de altura, láminas foliares de 2 mm o menos, y 5-7- mm de ancho, largamente acuminada","fuente":"Wikipedia (es)","url":"https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Setaria_parviflora"},"ciclo":{"valor":"Perenne","fuente":"Wikipedia (es)"},"forma":{"valor":"hierba","fuente":"Wikipedia (es)"},"fotosLibres":[{"fuente":"Wikimedia Commons","archivo":"Starr 040713-0118 Setaria parviflora.jpg","autor":"Forest & Kim Starr","lic":"CC BY 3.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","pagina":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Starr_040713-0118_Setaria_parviflora.jpg","nivel":"taxon"},{"fuente":"iNaturalist","url":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/50707544/medium.jpeg","autor":"葉子","lic":"CC0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.es","pagina":"https://www.inaturalist.org/photos/50707544","nivel":"taxon"},{"fuente":"iNaturalist","url":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/65065947/medium.jpeg","autor":"葉子","lic":"CC0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.es","pagina":"https://www.inaturalist.org/photos/65065947","nivel":"taxon"},{"fuente":"iNaturalist","url":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/358097316/medium.jpeg","autor":"Joseph Knight","lic":"CC BY-NC","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.es","pagina":"https://www.inaturalist.org/photos/358097316","nivel":"taxon"},{"fuente":"iNaturalist","url":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/327321350/medium.jpg","autor":"Nathan J Taylor","lic":"CC BY-NC","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.es","pagina":"https://www.inaturalist.org/photos/327321350","nivel":"taxon"}],"evc":{"url":"https://endemicascanarias.com/es/allcategories-es-es/introducidas/setaria-parviflora","titulo":"Especies Vegetales en Canarias","autoria":"Gerardo G. Casanova y colaboradores"},"mundo":{"nativa":["noroeste de EE.